                                                   564 ***********************************************************************
                                                   565 *     SSF Macro to help build test tables
                                                   566 ***********************************************************************
                                                   567          MACRO
                                                   568          SSF   &INST,&CC
                                                   569 .*                                &INST  - instruction under test
                                                   570 .*                                &CC    - expected CC
                                                   571 .*
                                                   572          LCLA  &XCC(4)  &CC has mask values for FAILED condition codes
                                                   573 &XCC(1)  SETA  7                  CC != 0
                                                   574 &XCC(2)  SETA  11                 CC != 1
                                                   575 &XCC(3)  SETA  13                 CC != 2
                                                   576 &XCC(4)  SETA  14                 CC != 3
                                                   577
                                                   578          GBLA  &TNUM
                                                   579 &TNUM    SETA  &TNUM+1
                                                   580
                                                   581          DS    0FD
                                                   582          USING *,R5               base for test data and test routine
                                                   583
                                                   584 T&TNUM   DC    A(X&TNUM)          address of test routine
                                                   585          DC    H'&TNUM'           test number
                                                   586          DC    XL1'00'
                                                   587          DC    HL1'&CC'           cc
                                                   588          DC    HL1'&XCC(&CC+1)'   cc failed mask
                                                   589          DC    XL1'00'
                                                   590
                                                   591          DC    CL8'&INST'         instruction name
                                                   592 O1A&TNUM DC    AD(RE&TNUM+8)      address of op1 source
                                                   593 O2A&TNUM DC    AD(RE&TNUM+16)     address of op2 source
                                                   594 O3A&TNUM DC    AD(RE&TNUM+24)     address of op3/R3 source
                                                   595          DC    A(8)               result length
                                                   596 REA&TNUM DC    AD(RE&TNUM)        result address
                                                   597          DS    FD                 gap
                                                   598 R3O&TNUM DS    D                  Op3/R3 Output
                                                   599          DS    FD                 gap
                                                   600 CCP&TNUM DS    2F                 extract PSW after test (has CC)
                                                   601 CCF&TNUM DS    X                  extracted cc
                                                   602          DS    FD
                                                   603 .*
                                                   604 *                                 INSTRUCTION UNDER TEST ROUTINE
                                                   605 X&TNUM   DS    0F
                                                   606          LG     R1,O1A&TNUM       get R1 source
                                                   607          LG     R2,O2A&TNUM       get R2 source
                                                   608          LG     R3,O3A&TNUM       get R3 source address
                                                   609          LG     R3,0(R3)          get R3 source value
                                                   610
